OL,5,G0400 The Directors
OL,6,     FJohn Ford is known for his
OL,7,     Fvisually powerful westerns with
OL,8,     Fhis characters framed against
OL,9,     FAmerica's stunning natural
OL,10,     Flandmarks. His four Academy Awards
OL,11,     Ffor Best Director remain a record.
OL,12,G0500 Batman
OL,13,     FZelda the Great. 1966. Stars Adam
OL,14,     FWest, Barbara Heller & Anne
OL,15,     FBaxter. Batman and Robin match
OL,16,     Fwits and escape techniques with
OL,17,     FZelda the Great and her fiendish
OL,18,     Fmaster.
